<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Obsidia Pilgrim Clan -->
  <ObsidiaPilgrimClan.label>黑曜石朝圣者部落</ObsidiaPilgrimClan.label>
  <!-- EN: They were once part ultratech colonists society from Obsidia planet, organized along military lines. Having rejected Obsidia Empire, many different factions were formed, but over time, only three main directions survived, which united into Obsidia Drifter Clans.\n\nObsidia Pilgrim Clan embody the cold vacuum of space - heartless and bent on taking anything left unprotected. Driven by profits.\n\nTheir goal is to enrich themselves by trading with hi-tech neighbors. -->
  <ObsidiaPilgrimClan.description>他们曾经是来自黑曜石星球的超高科技殖民者社会的一部分，按军事路线组织。拒绝了黑曜石帝国后，形成了许多不同的派系，但随着时间推移，只有三个主要方向幸存下来，它们联合成了黑曜石流浪者部落。\n\n黑曜石朝圣者部落体现了太空的寒冷真空——冷酷无情，一心要夺取任何未受保护的东西。以利润为驱动。\n\n他们的目标是通过与高科技邻居贸易来致富。</ObsidiaPilgrimClan.description>
  <!-- EN: admiral -->
  <ObsidiaPilgrimClan.leaderTitle>海军上将</ObsidiaPilgrimClan.leaderTitle>
  <!-- EN: {0} from {1} are attacking your {2}. -->
  <ObsidiaPilgrimClan.messageDefendersAttacking>来自{1}的{0}正在攻击你的{2}。</ObsidiaPilgrimClan.messageDefendersAttacking>
  <!-- EN: obsidian -->
  <ObsidiaPilgrimClan.pawnSingular>黑曜石</ObsidiaPilgrimClan.pawnSingular>
  <!-- EN: obsidians -->
  <ObsidiaPilgrimClan.pawnsPlural>黑曜石</ObsidiaPilgrimClan.pawnsPlural>
  
  <!-- EN: Obsidia Renegade Clan -->
  <ObsidiaRenegadeClan.label>黑曜石叛逆者部落</ObsidiaRenegadeClan.label>
  <!-- EN: They were once part ultratech colonists society from Obsidia planet, organized along military lines. Having rejected Obsidia Empire, many different factions were formed, but over time, only three main directions survived, which united into Obsidia Drifter Clans.\n\nObsidia Renegade Clan are sworn protectors of what little remains of the free colonies.\n\nTheir goal is to restore order by bringing prosperity and direction to the violent world. -->
  <ObsidiaRenegadeClan.description>他们曾经是来自黑曜石星球的超高科技殖民者社会的一部分，按军事路线组织。拒绝了黑曜石帝国后，形成了许多不同的派系，但随着时间推移，只有三个主要方向幸存下来，它们联合成了黑曜石流浪者部落。\n\n黑曜石叛逆者部落是自由殖民地残余部分的宣誓保护者。\n\n他们的目标是通过给暴力世界带来繁荣和方向来恢复秩序。</ObsidiaRenegadeClan.description>
  <!-- EN: mayor -->
  <ObsidiaRenegadeClan.leaderTitle>市长</ObsidiaRenegadeClan.leaderTitle>
