  <!-- EN: Obsidia Syndicate Clan -->
  <ObsidiaSyndicateClan.label>黑曜石辛迪加部落</ObsidiaSyndicateClan.label>
  <!-- EN: They were once part ultratech colonists society from Obsidia planet, organized along military lines. Having rejected Obsidia Empire, many different factions were formed, but over time, only three main directions survived, which united into Obsidia Drifter Clans.\n\nChange is sudden, violent, and a necessary force to ensure the planet can return to a state of growth. Obsidia Syndicate Clan see themselves as merely the instrument of this change.\n\nTheir goal is to raiding and robbing their more productive neighbors. -->
  <ObsidiaSyndicateClan.description>他们曾经是来自黑曜石星球的超高科技殖民者社会的一部分，按军事路线组织。拒绝了黑曜石帝国后，形成了许多不同的派系，但随着时间推移，只有三个主要方向幸存下来，它们联合成了黑曜石流浪者部落。\n\n变化是突然的、暴力的，是确保星球能够回到增长状态的必要力量。黑曜石辛迪加部落将自己视为这种变化的工具。\n\n他们的目标是袭击和抢劫他们更有生产力的邻居。</ObsidiaSyndicateClan.description>
  <!-- EN: boss -->
  <ObsidiaSyndicateClan.leaderTitle>老板</ObsidiaSyndicateClan.leaderTitle>
